{"about_the_game":"<strong>Avoid projectiles and enemies as you fight your way through the levels.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257220/extras/d45dec4dafc5ef04f146b445c0ed27fb.poster.avif?t=1759284833\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257220/extras/d45dec4dafc5ef04f146b445c0ed27fb.webm?t=1759284833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257220/extras/d45dec4dafc5ef04f146b445c0ed27fb.mp4?t=1759284833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Battle large and challenging bosses to unlock your way to the next level.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257220/extras/ee3e47b0cd3c13fb91e17a56c0f3cb74.poster.avif?t=1759284833\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257220/extras/ee3e47b0cd3c13fb91e17a56c0f3cb74.webm?t=1759284833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257220/extras/ee3e47b0cd3c13fb91e17a56c0f3cb74.mp4?t=1759284833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Use Attribute blocks to upgrade and change your weapons and abilities in fun combinations.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257220/extras/eef68fb8b07e624d43429a1013a9ab93.poster.avif?t=1759284833\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2257220/extras/eef68fb8b07e624d43429a1013a9ab93.webm?t=1759284833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><